      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am the author of \"禁忌JINJI‘s avatar world\".\n\nI am very disappointed with the official update.\n\nI have done a lot of interesting functions with Legacy Animation.\n\nI use emote to open them.\n\nSuch as lights, sounds, paintbrushes and so on.\n\nThis will not make my vive user.\n\nBecause it affects others by accidentally touching keys.\n\nHowever, all this hard work has become futile.\n\nMy world's Avatar emote function is totally useless.\n\nIn addition, all kinds of functions have failed.\n\nFor example, blink animation\n\nI use the blinking animation that closes Legacy Animation.\n\nTo prevent conflict between facial expression and blinking.\n\nThis will make my avatar more beautiful.\n\nNow it's gone.\n\nFacing me may be a complicated update.\n\nI feel very tired now.\n\nThis is said by translator.\n\nThere may be some problems.\n\nBut I still want to give Legacy Animation back to us.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
