      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Legacy animations will not be re-enabled for avatars beyond the cut-off time. They were removed for two main reasons: they were a major security risk that was being actively exploited by malicious users, and Unity is deprecating Legacy animations and they will eventually disappear (hence the title \"Legacy\").\n\nIf there is something that Animators are not capable of doing, please let us know and inform us of your use case either via email (support@vrchat.com) or via another Canny post.",
